Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:26:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(settings): configurable Agent Management entry target

Add a Display settings option that opens a chosen agent's settings directly from the sidebar Agent Management entry; the default keeps the agent list. The preference is stored locally (hermes_agent_manager_entry) with i18n for all locales plus unit and locale-parity tests.
